{"article_chars":117238,"article_normalization":"article-get-text-v1","article_text_sha256":"0d982532b1baa3216f62d8a1b481dc6ed670ed005ae32f7024aa69f00ab1a504","assurance":"self_attested_AI_reading_not_human_review","checked_table_count":7,"checked_table_ids":["S3.T1","S5.T2","S6.T3","S6.T4","S6.T5","S6.T6","S6.T7"],"checked_table_text_sha256":{"S3.T1":"6e47e0ce69dda4fa2896655efb6a2253bf6f795ae48bea6348b6ae4f4a33f8be","S5.T2":"7248550d4c51c5ce4ad1bdc4651e567f45935dcf36468e00b6ef6fa000081c1f","S6.T3":"8ba29cf2ea2fd7461cce85c7200501ae47f6d805e1044f5a45da5d25dcba5594","S6.T4":"15d9eb686f6c3b913d02f56da351f2cbee1133e7bbccd6510fd53c18759cc100","S6.T5":"249b125af889f20c4b2b2200b69c7b274404cef8d572794d7bb48142dfdf03c5","S6.T6":"e1118fea51efe638649f22ee839a8511d04b8bcd2fe119e94c51b4c39fb035d8","S6.T7":"c83b66e7436a4e1bf9be658e7cc3e03ceda497477f685b7ecff718f498269b32"},"declaration_sha256":"ae3a4227af8c0fd58c4b79f09dc315c77b11cb01bd579a2cf7c05a0426544f5e","findings_zh":[{"locator_text_sha256":{"S5.SS1":"9421e9f95269fd17f351cb771ec3dd37f94b494fea4fe167c17b6bba41fc591a"},"source_locator":"S5.SS1","text_zh":"方法对状态与动作联合扩散，结合接触前对齐、接触后目标引导和动力学一致性指导，以缓解对象无接触自行运动的ghost states。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S5.T2":"7248550d4c51c5ce4ad1bdc4651e567f45935dcf36468e00b6ef6fa000081c1f"},"source_locator":"S5.T2","text_zh":"门六个测试条件汇总报告59.2%，下一最佳Diffuser Guided Sampling为29.5%。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S6.T3":"8ba29cf2ea2fd7461cce85c7200501ae47f6d805e1044f5a45da5d25dcba5594"},"source_locator":"S6.T3","text_zh":"十个列出的任务设置汇总70.7%，条件DP为58.0%；该汇总同时列有full和half-side等不同条件。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S6.T5":"249b125af889f20c4b2b2200b69c7b274404cef8d572794d7bb48142dfdf03c5"},"source_locator":"S6.T5","text_zh":"LLM生成指导在门30度、半侧转笔、半钉任务分别40%、26.7%、43.3%，均低于手工指导70%、40%、46.7%。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A4":"ff87efa5f5069ce94c6ab9dec7bba14958d46f5fcad04fd425a47a48eda774e7"},"source_locator":"A4","text_zh":"附录实现报告单张GeForce RTX3090、每任务约30小时训练，学习率2e-4、batch256、500K步。"}],"human_reviewed":false,"images_inspected":false,"limitations_zh":[{"locator_text_sha256":{"S6":"a28973a3cc8a523142014754898094e1d998b6c127304b9f13634d3588387bde"},"source_locator":"S6","text_zh":"报告的五类任务均来自Adroit及Shadow Hand仿真环境，不能把接触丰富的物理仿真直接当成实体手验证。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S7":"ed47e03687cb2ae5f14a82a3fbf563a3d6f5180d396c7a619a60f79969b709e2"},"source_locator":"S7","text_zh":"结论将手状态感知和视觉对象位姿估计下的部署列为未来工作。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S6.SS7":"c8db3bc78b47f7bff6e60edfccd287d7329fc22b601e9a8361456467fb017033"},"source_locator":"S6.SS7","text_zh":"命令频率基准约5–7 Hz；36 Hz表述包含求解器加速和命令插值，不等同于36 Hz实机闭环推理验证。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S5.SS2":"515c4cf4d22a427ccf12177af3de5e55fab58fc6fec9d009eeae88382bff28d6"},"source_locator":"S5.SS2","text_zh":"LLM指导依赖详细环境语义和人工few-shot hints；原文将人工试错约20次降到5次，不是完全无需人工设计。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A5.SS2":"080ba015d32170da428599c9432e969f5badd948d8abaa2804d9a34cdbab6da3"},"source_locator":"A5.SS2","text_zh":"门任务提示词的get_obs返回注解写30维，却列到索引35共36维，不能原样当作无误接口规范。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A6.SS3":"c6d62648dc984cbfa134c98b41ca341b99326dc8e7f85fe8d7f1b0a3474c8713"},"source_locator":"A6.SS3","text_zh":"Hammer示例片段直接使用tool_pos但没有展示定义或传参，不能当作独立可运行函数；未执行或核验实际仓库代码。"}],"math_source_note_zh":"原阅读已完整覆盖公式alttext/TeX及逐行列科研表；本次核对本篇264个math节点，所读TeX与canonical保留的TeX表示一致，规范串另保留MathML/TeX重复及原空白。规范范围只是已读同一原文的统一字符坐标，不新增阅读内容；未查看图片公式、视觉渲染或外部补充材料。","observed_at":"2026-09-14T07:14:04Z","publisher_fulltext_or_media_completeness_verified":false,"range_basis":"already_read_article_with_equivalent_math_and_table_representations_reconciled_to_canonical_text","range_units":"python_unicode_characters_zero_based_half_open","raw_sha256":"2964178a226a1eae8abe547242fba3de3e6ace6bb9293b9695608948ffddc866","read_completed_at":"2026-09-14T08:44:39.852Z","read_ranges":[{"end":117238,"start":0}],"reader_kind":"AI","reading_id":"fulltext-reading:83a74009c01013a24a97f276","reading_status":"completed","schema_version":"1","source_availability_status":"full_text_available","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2411.18562v6","supplementa