559361cc636fe25a3f3eca4aeb22faed132376"},"source_locator":"S3.SS4.SSS0.Px1","text_zh":"正文掩码方案采样最大激活概率0.5，连续遮蔽最近一至五步观测。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S3.SS5.SSS0.Px2":"81819f903306d8b67e0c9c94e8fb91b3e8ae30d6ef8eb4efef786c0804ec1c8b"},"source_locator":"S3.SS5.SSS0.Px2","text_zh":"隐式动作修正对相邻预测动作取均值，只执行当前修正动作并在下一控制步重规划，保留闭环反馈。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S4.T2":"01791d6c2f05bfb09bb33a72dc3db16ea8dcaa0af8a2774bc1b1ad48ae703a88"},"source_locator":"S4.T2","text_zh":"表2单环境延迟为Mamba4.4 ms、MLP3.5 ms、Transformer9.8 ms，Mamba不是最低延迟者。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A2.SS0.SSS0.Px11":"b3db01fa1cd1b1a977e7f886c83cc3ad39b19f3834def1944210dca42adf4e1e"},"source_locator":"A2.SS0.SSS0.Px11","text_zh":"真实G1搭载Orin NX作计算和通信，高层50 Hz、低层500 Hz，报告通信延迟18–30 ms。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A2.T8":"0ddea36b9e4b26227a8d6a5e1e088af0a05cbb83efebb97d22a120e4f90d3d05"},"source_locator":"A2.T8","text_zh":"超参表列教师state维16、width256，学生state维16、width128。"}],"human_reviewed":false,"images_inspected":false,"limitations_zh":[{"locator_text_sha256":{"S5":"0c8f8b72eda1b04dbbe18a77ff7754cda48a6eca76bebafc3a035bf62f6d900c"},"source_locator":"S5","text_zh":"作者明确真实G1评估没有系统注入传感扰动；更广的损坏模式、地形和跨形态迁移仍属未来工作。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A4.SS0.SSS0.Px3":"acab0824f09b7cc0bf09d02197752dfa49f632384dfd336a00fa0e3e8a2d3198"},"source_locator":"A4.SS0.SSS0.Px3","text_zh":"真实chunk实验文字报告大小不超过3时稳定，4或5时会跌倒，不能描述为任意长动作块可靠执行。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S3.SS2":"14be4eb75d72aee887e6dd09aad5ee6f9955403c520ada8926dfe3fcc1e353b0"},"source_locator":"S3.SS2","text_zh":"当前实现每个控制步重新处理完整历史窗口，复杂度为O(L)，不能按状态空间模型潜在性质直接称本实现为O(1)。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2":"04907a18adeca865aa01b9a0252dd4c4a5a7ada40c5aff909fdbfb3f354eb363"},"source_locator":"A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2","text_zh":"Baselines段给出的Mamba state维是256，复现时须核对这处配置而不静默替换原值。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A2.T7.2.1.1.2.1":"9791c9a3c7a09d7a63004eb4e85bd28ba0357f544a8bd287d090d935f8de287b"},"source_locator":"A2.T7.2.1.1.2.1","text_zh":"教师和学生表列出五组29维状态、3维角速度与6维参考方向，合计154维，却把总维度写成145×35。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2":"d1172e5b95b1ff609f298d25a92d48d63cce2b764818d0ef2298fbc96cd00580"},"source_locator":"A3.SS0.SSS0.Px2","text_zh":"此附录将主chunk实验的连续mask范围描述为一至三，并另测一至四和一至五；需要按各实验条件分别复现。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3":"53aec78b4c0490eb693b4cb4c8fa0f8dafde3b3c273aeed81131023ef9a6d4c8"},"source_locator":"A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3","text_zh":"指标段把mpjpe单位标毫米，却用DoF旋转误差解释，指标定义与单位需要核对。"}],"math_source_note_zh":"原阅读已完整覆盖公式alttext/TeX及逐行列科研表；本次核对本篇212个math节点，所读TeX与canonical保留的TeX表示一致，规范串另保留MathML/TeX重复及原空白。规范范围只是已读同一原文的统一字符坐标，不新增阅读内容；未查看图片公式、视觉渲染或外部补充材料。","observed_at":"2026-09-14T07:14:08Z","publisher_fulltext_or_media_completeness_verified":false,"range_basis":"already_read_article_with_equivalent_math_and_table_representations_reconciled_to_canonical_text","range_units":"python_unicode_characters_zero_based_half_open","raw_sha256":"3913d9ed90ce9843eb7862cbf391362cb775af5617acd33d9bb85785bda9c3dd","read_completed_at":"2026-09-14T08:44:39.854Z","read_ranges":[{"end":72993,"start":0}],"reader_kind":"AI","reading_id":"fulltext-reading:8d057f26c7a1d495887c15d6","reading_status":"completed","schema_version":"1","source_availability_status":"full_text_available","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2609.07096v2","supplementary_materials_inspected":false,"supplementary_scope_note":"external_media_only; embedded_appendix_text_is_within_article_scope","tables_exhaustive":false,"text_scope":"complete_available_article_text","transport_verification":"legacy_unrecorded","understanding_verified":false,"verification_scope":"source_identity_hash_ranges_and_locators_only","version":"v2","work_id":"arxiv:2609.07096"}
