{"article_chars":100663,"article_normalization":"article-get-text-v1","article_text_sha256":"30846caa2611d6c9fbed82316ca8670f05649ca84bdc7c39f8795044a3b897bb","assurance":"self_attested_AI_reading_not_human_review","checked_table_count":0,"checked_table_ids":[],"checked_table_text_sha256":{},"declaration_sha256":"4740bf82b54fadf6ebb9f95b029f8b8d7a486401fd1fc0656a8f1ed59edf1874","findings_zh":[{"locator_text_sha256":{"S2.SS2.SSS0.Px3":"a7d65a2b5379298bac9c564d2114ee90c57c0c8d15f283126e0f76f09f7af854"},"source_locator":"S2.SS2.SSS0.Px3","text_zh":"自改进阶段冻结SFT检查点生成奖励和成功信号，更新策略采用不复用数据的on-policy REINFORCE。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S4.SS1.SSS2.Px1":"01ed263a20a12087c5993e333476e4a1b3cf056a6ee2b893adff1e4f1673f338"},"source_locator":"S4.SS1.SSS2.Px1","text_zh":"真实LanguageTable结果文字报告约62–63%升至87–88%，增加约3%的Block2Block回合；未独立读取图中曲线。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S4.SS3.SSS2.Px1":"3668ef5432da7f89ee97df130df48fb4e9e4b1d1efcf2eeda945a746654afafb"},"source_locator":"S4.SS3.SSS2.Px1","text_zh":"BananaTable在两台站点约八小时自改进后，文字报告成功率由约63%升至85%。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A1.SS4":"86a392a476436bfd2f90fbe9a43759b2d2979d1f31fd83ae4909a6f324454878"},"source_locator":"A1.SS4","text_zh":"SFT配置交替使用64 TPUv4（2×4×4）或128 TPUv3；奖励模型和成功检测器分别使用4 TPUv4。数量单位按原文保留。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A4.SS3":"3dc8f959bbfecb44b0463d95f6de63393e7b433097005b374cbb507deae3fb91"},"source_locator":"A4.SS3","text_zh":"ALOHA仿真数据先用实体leader机器人控制MuJoCo虚拟机器人收集800条示范，再训练扩散策略生成更大成功轨迹集。"}],"human_reviewed":false,"images_inspected":false,"limitations_zh":[{"locator_text_sha256":{"A6":"524af46b29a7fa5990cdda7c9cd35c8029dc6d8560a82c7fc9cc1052ffe93b13"},"source_locator":"A6","text_zh":"真实实验仍需要一位操作员监控全部机器人，在掉块或三至五分钟未打乱时进行复位，不是无人值守学习。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S4.SS1.SSS3":"887dacbe435940958bcdf343c2bbc213def7ed3892b2dc7d4832c024bc1e2dc3"},"source_locator":"S4.SS1.SSS3","text_zh":"ALOHA模拟插入因相机无法观察完全插入的成功状态，额外加入成功时的正奖励，不能概括为所有实验完全没有真值信号。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A9.SS0.SSS0.Px3":"5dd59323e38eebd0b7eb9fa026bf841c725426551ee5753dc2a9c74f4c83d355"},"source_locator":"A9.SS0.SSS0.Px3","text_zh":"真实ALOHA只完成BC策略和短暂基础设施验证，完整Self-Improvement实验未完成。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A9.SS0.SSS0.Px2":"058b0de7ce01657556abf64327a987628e9f64a77abf8b32bc6f417afce8dce8"},"source_locator":"A9.SS0.SSS0.Px2","text_zh":"全指令真实实验因部分时间的站点人为布置不当被排除，且没有重新完成实验。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S4.SS3.SSS1":"c437b9bc39320e5c92cc67ed601297caf2d071c7b8037d665a1d3a2e7cae8f1f"},"source_locator":"S4.SS3.SSS1","text_zh":"本节实际研究的是Real2Sim转移，不是已经完成的Sim2Real转移实验。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4":"23bc09c789ebe21dab6665105049a1aba9aec8fa0a296f98ee6a40854e55bad4"},"source_locator":"S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4","text_zh":"作者观察到超过性能峰值后继续自改进会降低成功率，停止准则和正则化仍待研究。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"A8":"741d6f6abb675bdb1f0ba725129a438dff9c1f1584cd24c3ea5ac59f0da1725c"},"source_locator":"A8","text_zh":"Block2Block比例由Gemini分类估计；Hoeffding误差界只处理抽样波动，不能代替对分类错误的核验。"},{"locator_text_sha256":{"S3.SS0.SSS0.Px2":"9ca51ac77ea0a3d3d5f787443fc98beb3dd4a2f35fc445f7752e203e28113d02"},"source_locator":"S3.SS0.SSS0.Px2","text_zh":"数学直觉定义的指示函数写成目标满足时取负，但文字解释为目标满足时零、其他时负一，存在符号与文字不一致。"}],"math_source_note_zh":"原阅读已完整覆盖公式alttext/TeX及逐行列科研表；本次核对本篇144个math节点，所读TeX与canonical保留的TeX表示一致，规范串另保留MathML/TeX重复及原空白。规范范围只是已读同一原文的统一字符坐标，不新增阅读内容；未查看图片公式、视觉渲染或外部补充材料。","observed_at":"2026-09-14T07:14:19Z","publisher_fulltext_or_media_completeness_verified":false,"range_basis":"already_read_article_with_equivalent_math_and_table_representations_reconciled_to_canonical_text","range_units":"python_unicode_characters_zero_based_half_open","raw_sha256":"fb92a258393a77f7f6d6b99cff1b26d64e7f3105b96193a6bb0c55664d14ba07","read_completed_at":"2026-09-14T08:44:39.849Z","read_ranges":[{"end":100663,"start":0}],"reader_kind":"AI","reading_id":"fulltext-reading:d99f1c5c37c363de431fc43e","reading_status":"completed","schema_version":"1","source_availability_status":"full_text_available","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/html/2509.15155v1","supplementary_materials_inspected":false,"supplementary_scope_note":"exte